%% sequence_anomaly_lifecycle.mmd v2
%% v2 changes vs v1:
%%   added Trace participant showing the shared_trace JSONL append per stage
%%   added dual-route fan-out for node_firmware (parallel O2 IMS + TMF921 emission, scenario E)
%%   added scenario D divergence annotation (software_ok vs hardware_anomaly verdict split)
%% A day in the life of a PTP anomaly. Operator step (the commit) is the bottleneck and the
%% gating point. That is the architectural argument the talk's audience needs to see.
%% Companion to architecture.mmd (macro) and trust_loop.md.

sequenceDiagram
    participant Edge as Edge (linuxptp + cloud-event-proxy)
    participant Gateway as Agentic Gateway
    participant Agents as Domain Agents (Plat/RAN/HW)
    participant Router as Remediation Router
    participant Twin as Digital Twin
    participant Guard as Guardrail Engine
    participant Op as NOC Operator
    participant OCloud as O-Cloud Manager (O2 IMS)
    participant SMO as Partner SMO (TMF921)
    participant Trace as Trace JSONL (shared_trace/*.jsonl)

    Edge->>Edge: ptp4l master offset spike detected
    Edge->>Gateway: CloudEvent FaultPayload (with verdict)
    Gateway->>Trace: append fault_payload
    Note over Edge,Gateway: Scenario D divergence: linuxptp reports SYNCHRONIZED (software_ok),<br/>NIC reports tx_hwtstamp_timeouts rising (hardware_anomaly)
    Gateway->>Agents: dispatch to relevant agents
    Agents->>Trace: append per-agent findings
    Agents->>Router: RCA artifact (cross-domain evidence)
    Router->>Trace: append RCA
    Router->>Router: consult taxonomy.yaml (deterministic first)
    alt taxonomy resolves to ambiguous_path
        Router->>Router: invoke LLM (ORAN_LLM_MODE gate, ambiguous only)
    end
    Router->>Twin: proposed action for Sandbox test flight
    Twin-->>Router: apply-allowed signal (or reject)
    Router->>Twin: inverse action for Recoverability validation
    Twin-->>Router: rollback-confirmed signal
    Router->>Guard: RemediationProposal with twin verdicts
    Router->>Trace: append proposal
    Guard->>Guard: evaluate blast radius, allowlist, dry_run_default
    Guard->>Op: AuditEvent (TMF688) plus ReversibilityProfile
    Guard->>Trace: append audit event
    Note over Op: Operator reads, edits per co_authorization, commits
    Op->>Guard: humanApprovalStatus approved
    Guard->>OCloud: apply_remediation (gated tool call, DOWN route)
    alt action.type == apply_metal3_firmware (scenario E, dual-route)
        Guard->>SMO: TMF921 companion intent (UP route, parallel)
        SMO-->>Guard: intent_id ack
        Guard->>Trace: append companion_intent emission
    end
    OCloud->>Edge: MachineConfig or KMM Module CR or HostFirmwareComponents (via spoke operators)
    Edge-->>Gateway: state-change CloudEvent (convergence)
    Gateway->>Trace: append convergence
    Note over Op: Bottleneck: the human is the gatekeeper in the timeline
